[31m[1mError: [22mInvalid client module[39m

The `client_module` setting in the `[tools.dream_squirrel]` table of
[4mgleam.toml[24m is `"Dream-Pog"`, which is not a valid Gleam module name.

Hint: A module name is made of lowercase names separated by slashes, like
`dream_pog` or `my_app/database`. Each name starts with a lowercase letter and
can only contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores.
